id: pm-z1z96w
title: "GH-1144: hash-only merge receipts contradict report output and cannot reconcile truthfully"
description: "GitHub issue #1144 proves that tracked hash_only merge receipts are reported as clone_local, remain pending forever because the reconciler demands unavailable values, and can report outcome repaired despite zero rehashes and an untrusted snapshot."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[6]: "area:merge","area:sdk",context-integrity,github-1144,merge-receipts,multi-agent
created_at: "2026-08-28T21:25:58.746Z"
updated_at: "2026-08-29T17:11:07.732Z"
closed_at: "2026-08-29T17:11:07.105Z"
completed_at: "2026-08-29T17:11:07.105Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 420
acceptance_criteria: Merge report renders stored value_availability separately from evidence provenance and never labels tracked receipts clone-local; Hash-only receipts reconcile without force when their recorded hashes prove the current canonical snapshot; Untrusted or no-effect reconciliation never reports repaired; Pending and reconciled state transitions remain auditable and fail closed when proof is insufficient; SDK CLI docs merge-driver temp-repository and exact coverage gates pass
parent: pm-dj98
risk: critical
confidence: high
reporter: GitHub issue #1144
severity: critical
environment: pm 2026.8.28 with committed hash_only receipts produced by the field-aware merge driver
repro_steps: Inspect a tracked pending hash_only receipt; compare pm merge report value_availability and evidence_source; run merge reconcile dry-run and observe untrusted proof plus outcome repaired with zero repair.
resolution: "Aligned merge-safety guidance with proof-gated reconciliation: authoritative exact hash proof settles hash-only discarded-value receipts without force; force remains the explicit reviewed fallback for unproven receipts."
expected_result: Documentation mirrors executable reconciliation and never demands redundant force when canonical receipt hashes already prove the merged snapshot.
actual_result: "MERGE_SAFETY documents unforced proof-backed settlement, unforced history_drift_merge_receipt remediation, and the narrower force boundary for reviewed receipts lacking qualifying proof."
component: "SDK merge receipt report, proof, reconcile, health, and CLI adapters"
customer_impact: Normal multi-agent merges permanently poison health signals and pressure agents toward an unnecessary history ownership override.
