comments[14]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-28T21:25:58.746Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check evidence: complete all-status search found closed pm-lwmstb for post-merge remediation routing and pm-ysqb6n for pending receipt visibility plus pm-9j2r3b for merge history addressability. None owns hash-only proof impossibility or report field contradiction. This recurrence is canonical for GitHub 1144."
  "2026-08-28T21:26:38.284Z","harness:codex","GitHub linkage evidence: issue #1144 now points to this canonical item at the merge-stable main-branch toon path."
  "2026-08-28T23:24:20.262Z","harness:codex","Verification evidence: SDK, CLI, and temporary-repository merge receipt suites passed; live history validation found zero drift across 2,596 items; full repository coverage passed 8,099 tests at exact 100/100/100/100."
  "2026-08-29T02:22:14.859Z","harness:codex","Review-round evidence: history repair now treats caller receipts only as requested identifiers and reloads authoritative clone-local or durable receipt files before canonical field and hash verification. Forged, incomplete, mismatched, missing-path, bad-hash, dry-run, and non-dry-run controls pass; temporary-repository integration and exact coverage pass."
  "2026-08-29T06:08:44.827Z","harness:codex","Final CodeRabbit review finding: MERGE_SAFETY still describes qualifying history-repair evidence as clone-local only and incorrectly says durable-only evidence always fails closed. Reopened for documentation parity with authoritative durable receipt reload and exact proof."
  "2026-08-29T06:28:57.024Z","harness:codex","Final review evidence: merge-safety guidance now matches executable durable receipt recovery semantics and retains fail-closed legacy/tamper behavior. Focused merge tests, full 8,112-test exact coverage, quality:static, and linked acceptance passed."
  "2026-08-29T10:42:51.488Z","harness:codex","TDD review evidence: the untrusted-proof refusal still named clone-local evidence only even though authoritative durable receipt files are accepted after exact path, field, and value-hash verification. The rejection regression now requires both authoritative sources, while preserving mismatch review and --force guidance."
  "2026-08-29T10:58:56.273Z","harness:codex","Final review evidence: linked acceptance passed 2/2 commands with 24 assertions across connected context-integrity and merge-reconcile suites. The dedicated refusal contract also passed in the focused 22-test TDD set. Full repository coverage passed 586 files and 8,119 tests at exact 100/100/100/100; static and security gates passed."
  "2026-08-29T13:08:19.498Z","harness:codex","CodeRabbit exact-head coverage finding: proof classification is tested, but the public merge reconcile path lacks a negative control that a mismatched merged_field_hashes receipt fails reconciliation and remains pending without --force. Reopened for a temporary Git repository CLI regression."
  "2026-08-29T13:12:32.466Z","harness:codex","Review follow-up: added a CLI/full-reconcile negative control proving a mismatched merged_field_hashes receipt fails closed without force, reconciles zero receipts, and remains pending on a subsequent dry-run. The focused merge/recovery suite passes."
  "2026-08-29T13:27:10.457Z","harness:codex","Final local evidence: exact coverage passed 586 files and 8,122 tests at 100/100/100/100; pnpm quality:static passed; linked acceptance passed 3/3, including the CLI negative control for forged merged-field hashes."
  "2026-08-29T16:48:27.034Z","harness:codex","Exact-head review follow-up: MERGE_SAFETY still claims discarded-value receipts require --force even when their exact current merged-value hash proof is authoritative. The implementation settles proven hash-only lossy receipts without force; the documentation must distinguish proof-backed settlement from explicit force for unproven/manual acceptance."
  "2026-08-29T17:09:54.567Z","harness:codex","Documentation correction implemented: proof-backed hash-only discarded-value receipts may settle without force and history_drift_merge_receipt may emit the unforced apply command; --force is documented only for reviewed receipts lacking qualifying exact proof. Full 8,124-test suite and exact 100/100/100/100 coverage pass."
  "2026-08-29T17:11:06.411Z","harness:codex","Final review-fix evidence: linked merge acceptance passed 2 unique commands with the shared regression deduplicated; full repository coverage passed 8,124 tests at exact 100/100/100/100; documentation and contract assurance passed before the baseline-reproduced local RSS-only stop."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-29T06:28:56.584Z","harness:codex","Recovery documentation must distinguish where evidence is stored from what makes it authoritative: durable-only receipts qualify only after exact canonical path, declared-field, and merged-value hash verification."
